Findings: UserRegistry inherits PermissionedRegistry and does not override register, transfer, role grant/revoke, or isEmancipated. Safe transfer checks emancipation before per-token ROLE_CAN_TRANSFER_ADMIN; unsafe variants bypass emancipation but retain token-resource role check. `4097 = ROLE_REGISTRAR | ROLE_UNREGISTER`; if assigned at root, it contributes a forbidden root role. `0x4b27a133` is generic EACUnauthorizedAccountRoles, not a direct transfer update gate. All matrix expectations are source-derived; matrix UNEXECUTED and runtime cells 2b-type / UNAUTHORIZED. Actual Sepolia state NOT OBSERVED. No transactions, signing, tests, Git actions, env access, or files outside the two authorized docs paths.
